{
  "file_id": "3618",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 66,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "*sigh* How long are we gonna have\nto keep doing this...",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6840,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "(suspiro) ¿Cuánto tiempo más\nvamos a seguir así...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "What does that black thing want\nwith us?",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6896,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¿Qué quiere esa cosa negra\nde nosotros?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Well, we've got to stop it,\nwhatever it's doing. Let's look\nfor clues.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6937,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "Bueno, hay que detenerlo,\nsea lo que sea. Busquemos\npistas."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "There's someone here!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7008,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Hay alguien aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "You're back!",
      "speaker_id": 7091,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7030,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Volviste!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "??",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7043,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "??"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Is he talking to us?",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7046,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¿Habla con nosotros?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Playing me for a fool, huh? Well,\nit's my turn!",
      "speaker_id": 7091,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7067,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "¿Me tomas por tonto? ¡Pues\nahora me toca a mí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "We have *no* idea what you're\ntalking about!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7115,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡No tenemos ni idea de qué\nhablas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Agumon! Run!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7160,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Corre!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Take that!",
      "speaker_id": 7091,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7173,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Toma esto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Aaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7184,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "W-Waaaaaaait!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7194,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡E-Espera!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Who are you?",
      "speaker_id": 7091,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7208,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¿Quién eres?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I'm not exactly sure what's going\non, but I think you have him\nmistaken for someone else...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7221,
      "_bytes": 91,
      "translation": "No sé muy bien qué pasa,\npero creo que lo confundes\ncon otra persona..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 7091,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7313,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Tai, get away from there! I'll\ntake him on!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7317,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Tai, ¡apártate! ¡Yo me\nencargo de él!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "It's okay, Hackmon. Those eyes\ndon't look like they want to\nfight.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7364,
      "_bytes": 66,
      "translation": "Calma, Hackmon. Sus ojos\nno parecen los de alguien\nque quiere pelear."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "They look like pretty gentle\neyes...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7431,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "Parecen unos ojos muy\namables..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Looks like I was wrong, then.",
      "speaker_id": 7091,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7468,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Entonces me equivoqué."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "I'm Takuya Kanbara. Sorry for\nstartling you there...",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7498,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Soy Takuya Kanbara. Siento\nhaberos asustado..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "A human?!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7551,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡¿Un humano?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "A human evolved into a Digimon?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7561,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¿Un humano evolucionó a Digimon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Well, it's kinda like that...",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7593,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Bueno, algo así..."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Why'd you attack us all of a\nsudden?",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7623,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¿Por qué nos atacaste\nde repente?"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Sorry about that. A while back,\nsome human with the same Digimon\nas you attacked me.",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7660,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "Perdón por eso. Hace tiempo,\nun humano con el mismo Digimon\nque tú me atacó."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "There's another one of me?",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7745,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¿Hay otro yo por ahí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "I guess there's a copy of Agumon\nrunning around too, huh?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7772,
      "_bytes": 57,
      "translation": "Supongo que también hay\nuna copia de Agumon suelta."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Considering what's happened so\nfar, I wouldn't be surprised.",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7830,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "Con todo lo que ha pasado,\nno me sorprendería."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Anyway, I'm glad we didn't end up\nfighting each other for some\nstupid reason...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7891,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "Bueno, me alegro de que no\nacabáramos peleando por\nalguna tontería..."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Yeah, I'm glad we avoided that,\ntoo.",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7971,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "Sí, yo también me alegro\nde evitarlo."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "I'm guessing you were trapped\nhere, too. Wanna help us out?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8008,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "Supongo que tú también\nestás atrapado. ¿Nos ayudas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "You too, huh? ...Okay, sure!",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8068,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Tú también, ¿eh? ¡Vale, claro!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "So, about what you were saying\nearlier... a *human* attacked you?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8097,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "Sobre lo que decías antes...\n¿te atacó un humano?"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Hmm... He looked like a middle\nschool student, and he had an\nAgumon with him.",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8163,
      "_bytes": 77,
      "translation": "Parecía un chico de\nsecundaria, y llevaba\nun Agumon con él."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "But when he did, you were probably\na Digimon at the time...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8241,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "Pero entonces tú serías\nun Digimon en ese momento..."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Yeah, I was.",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8301,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Sí, lo era."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "A middle school student attacking\na Digimon...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8314,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Un chico de secundaria\natacando a un Digimon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "What kind of guy was that?",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8361,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¿Qué clase de tipo era?"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Well, he had a really strong\npunch...",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8388,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Bueno, tenía un puñetazo\nmuy fuerte..."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "The last person to hit me that\nhard was the goalkeeper, during\none of our matches...",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8426,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "La última vez que me pegaron\nasí de fuerte fue el portero,\nen un partido..."
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Wait, you play soccer, too?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8511,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¿Juegas al fútbol también?"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "You play?",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8539,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¿Juegas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Yeah, I'm in the soccer club.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8549,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Sí, juego al fútbol."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Whoa!",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8579,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Vaya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "I tend to do a lot of heading, so\nour goalkeeper tends to punch me a\nlot...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8585,
      "_bytes": 75,
      "translation": "Remato mucho de cabeza, así\nque el portero me suele\npegar bastante..."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Been there, done that!",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8661,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¡Te entiendo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "What's soccer? Some kind of human\nmartial arts?",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8684,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "¿Qué es fútbol? ¿Un tipo de\narte marcial humano?"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "No, no!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8732,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡No, no!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8740,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "!!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8744,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Hey! Who are you?",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8747,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Oye! ¿Quién eres?"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "It's another fake...",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8765,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "Otro falso más..."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "All right, let's work together!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8786,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Bien, trabajemos juntos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "*whew* That's over.",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8818,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Uf... eso ya pasó."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "We're done with this one!",
      "speaker_id": 7181,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8838,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Con este ya terminamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "But now we have to leave Takuya...",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8864,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "Ahora hay que dejar a Takuya..."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "We didn't get to see each other\nfor very long, but I learned a lot\nfrom you guys!",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8899,
      "_bytes": 81,
      "translation": "¡No pudimos estar juntos\nmucho tiempo, pero aprendí\nmucho de vosotros!"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I'm glad I met you!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 8981,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Me alegro de conocerte!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Yeah! It was fun, talking about\nsoccer!",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9001,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡Sí! ¡Fue divertido hablar\nde fútbol!"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "See you, Takuya!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9041,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Adiós, Takuya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Yeah, let's meet again!",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9058,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡Sí, veámonos de nuevo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "So there's another person here...\nwell, I'm gonna have to get myself\nall fired up!",
      "speaker_id": 7031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 9082,
      "_bytes": 82,
      "translation": "¡Así que hay alguien más aquí...\npues voy a ponerme\nlas pilas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "　　　　　　【Area 1】",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 9165,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "Zona 1"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "　　　　　　【Area 2】",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 9188,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "Zona 2"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "　　　　　　【Area 3】",
      "speaker_id": 9003,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 9211,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "Zona 3"
    }
  ]
}